    public function createTicket(array $d):array {$u=$this->requireUser();$subject=$this->text($d,'subject',180);$category=$this->text($d,'category',80);$message=$this->text($d,'message',6000);$id=$this->db->transaction(function()use($u,$subject,$category,$message){$id=$this->db->insert('support_tickets',['number'=>'CRM-'.strtoupper(bin2hex(random_bytes(4))),'user_id'=>$u['id'],'subject'=>$subject,'category'=>$category,'status'=>'open','priority'=>'normal','created_at'=>$this->now(),'updated_at'=>$this->now()]);$this->db->insert('ticket_messages',['ticket_id'=>$id,'user_id'=>$u['id'],'message'=>$message,'internal'=>0,'created_at'=>$this->now()]);$this->queueEmail($u['email'],'ticket_created',['ticket_id'=>$id],'ticket-'.$id);return $id;});return $this->ticket($id);}
    public function ticket(int $id):array {$u=$this->requireUser();$t=$this->db->one('SELECT * FROM support_tickets WHERE id=?',[$id]);$staff=in_array($u['role'],['admin','super_admin','support'],true);if(!$t||(!$staff&&(int)$t['user_id']!==(int)$u['id']))throw new HttpError('Ticket not found.',404);$t['messages']=$this->db->all('SELECT m.*,u.name author FROM ticket_messages m JOIN users u ON u.id=m.user_id WHERE m.ticket_id=?'.($staff?'':' AND m.internal=0').' ORDER BY m.id',[$id]);return $t;}
